{"strings":["LPCO","Details related to Licenses, Permits, Certificates or Others.","Document expiration date/time","Date and time of expiration of the document (e.g. license, visa, permit, certificate).","Document identifier","Identification of a specific document.","Document reference number, assigned by the Government","Document issuing date/time","Date and time the document was issued and when appropriate, signed or otherwise authenticated.","Document issuing location identifier","Identification of the location at which a document was issued and when appropriate, signed or otherwise authenticated.","UN/LOCODE","Document issuing location name","Name of the location at which a document was issued and when needed, signed or otherwise authenticated.","Document name","Name of the document.","Transitional element","Document name code","Code specifying the name of a document.","UN/EDIFACT code list 1001 OR User code list","Authentication","Details related to the authentication of a document.","Authentication statement","Statement providing proof that the document has been authenicated.","Authenticator","Details related to an authenticating party.","Authenticator name","Name of the party which certifies that a document is authentic.","Authenticator identifier","Identification of a party which certifies that a document is authentic.","International codes (e.g. DUNS, EAN) OR User codes","Role code","Code specifying the role of a party.","UN/EDIFACT code list 3035","AuthorizedPerson","Details related to a person designated under relevant legislation for the purpose of issuing official assurances.","Authorised person name","Name of a person designated under relevant legislation for the purpose of issuing official assurances.","Authorized person identifier","Identification of a person designated under relevant legislation for the purpose of issuing official assurances.","AdditionalInformation","Details related to the special request from declarant to government to take or not to take action.","In case of using Additional statement code, text or indicator you can make the information more specific by also using Additional statement type.\nIf there are more than 1 occurrences you should always use it in combination with the type.","Additional statement code","Code specifying the form of an additional statement.","User code list","Additional statement description","Description of an additional statement.","Additional statement type code","Code specifying the subject of the additional statement.","StatementTypeCodeList","Consignment","Details related to the transport between a consignor and a consignee as specified in the transport contract document.","BorderTransportMeans","Details related to the means of transport crossing the border of the Customs territory.","Crossing the border transport means name","Name to identify the means of transport used for the carriage of the goods in crossing the border.","Transport means crossing the border identifier","Identification of the means of transport used in crossing the border.","Sea: ITU Standard or Lloyd's number\nAir: IATA aircraft ID\nRoad: national license plate\nRail: locomotive number","ConsignmentItem","Details related to an item in a consignment.","Commodity","Details related to the properties of the goods.","Goods description","Description of the nature of a goods item sufficient to identify it for cross-border regulatory purposes such as customs, phytosanitary, statistical or transport.","Commodity lot identifier","Identification of the production lot by number.","Product","Details related to the tangible article or substance produced by human or mechanical effort or by a natural process.","Product identifier","Identification of an object, for example the unique number affixed by the manufacturer to a product for identification purposes.","Commodity identifier type code","Code specifying the type of commodity identifier.","UN/EDIFACT code list 7143","ProductCharacteristics","Details related to the characteristics of a product.","Commodity characteristic code","Code specifying the commodity characteristics such as goods grading, genetic modification, quality, etc. that distinguishes the commodity from similar commodities.","Commodity characteristics description","Description of the commodity characteristics (e.g. goods grading, genetic modification, quality, etc.) that distinguishes the commodity from similar commodities.","DestinationLocation","Details related to the destination location.","Destination country code","Code specifying the country of destination.","CountryCodeList","Destination country name","Name of the country of destination.","Destination region identifier","Identification of a country's subdivision of destination.","ExaminationLocation","Details related to the location of physical examination.","Examination location name","Name of the location where goods are to be examined if different from the specified goods item location.","Examination location identifier","Identification of a location where goods are to be examined if different from the specified goods item location.","UN/LOCODE + User codes","GoodsMeasure","Details related to goods weight, quantities, and amounts.","Net net weight","Weight of the goods themselves without any packing.","Origin","Details related to the origin of the goods.","Country of origin code","Code specifying the country in which the goods have been produced or manufactured, according to criteria laid down for the application of the Customs tariff or quantitative restrictions, or any measure related to trade.","Packaging","Details related to packaging.","Sequence number","Number indicating the position in a sequence.","Number of packages","Quantity specifying the number of individual items packaged in such a way that they cannot be divided without first undoing the packing.","Type of packages identification code","Code specifying the type of package of an item.","PackageTypeCodeList","Packer","Details related to the party packing goods.","Packer name","Name of the party packing goods.","Packer identifier","Identification of the party packing goods.","Address","Details related to an address.","Address type code","Code specifying the type of address.","AddressTypeCodeList","City name","Name of a city.","Country code","Code specifying the name of the country or other geographical entity as specified in ISO 3166 and UN/ECE Rec 3.","Country name","Name of the country or other geographical entity.","Country sub-entity identification code","Code specifying the name of a country subdivision.","ISO 3166-2 OR User code list","Country sub-entity name","Name of a country subdivision.","Street and number/P.O. Box","Specification of the postal delivery point such as street and number or post office box.","Not to be used in combination with Street name, House number, House number addition and P.O. Box","Postcode identifier","Identification of the postal zone or address.","Control","Details related to (governmental) examination.","Certifier","Details related to the party which certifies something.","Certifier name","Name of the party who has provided the certification.","Certifying party identifier","Identification of a party which certifies something.","GovernmentProcedure","Details related to the current and previous government procedure.","Government procedure code","Code specifying a procedure.","UN/EDIFACT code list 7365\nFor Customs:  User codes, categorized based on the revised Kyoto Convention","TradingParty","Details related to the party responsible for the trade of commercial products.","Trading party name","Name of the party responsible for the trade of commercial products.","Trading party identifier","Identification of the party responsible for the trade of commercial products.","ContactOffice","Details related to the location of a government agency contact office.","Contact office identifier","Identification of the location of a government office where contact can be made."],"root":{"s":"LPCO","n":0,"d":1,"t":"C","c":"","w":"74B","u":"0001L","q":"1","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/LPCO","src":"BIP LPCO:4","k":[{"s":"expiration","n":2,"d":3,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"ExpirationDateTime","f":"an..35","w":"D051","u":"0001L","q":"4","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/expirationDateTime","ub":["cites","eata","ecoc","etir-carv"],"src":"BIP LPCO:7"},{"s":"identification","n":4,"d":5,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"ID","f":"an..70","r":6,"w":"D014","u":"0001L","q":"7","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/identificationIdentifier","ub":["cites","codex","e-phyto","eata","ecoc","etir-carv","oie-cert"],"src":"BIP LPCO:10"},{"s":"issue","n":7,"d":8,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"IssueDateTime","f":"an..35","w":"D011","u":"0001L","q":"8","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/issueDateTime","ub":["cites","eata","ecoc","ecoo","oie-cert"],"src":"BIP LPCO:11"},{"s":"issueLocation","n":9,"d":10,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"IssueLocationID","f":"an..5","w":"D012","u":"0001L","q":"9","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/issueLocationIdentifier","l":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/code-list/external/un-locode-list","ln":11,"ub":["atiga-coo","cites","ecoc"],"src":"BIP LPCO:12"},{"s":"issueLocationName","n":12,"d":13,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"IssueLocation","f":"an..256","w":"D034","u":"0001L","q":"10","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/issueLocationNameText","ub":["atiga-coo","cites","ecoc"],"src":"BIP LPCO:13"},{"s":"name","n":14,"d":15,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"Name","f":"an..35","r":16,"w":"D032","u":"0001L","q":"12","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/nameText","ub":["cites","ecoc"],"src":"BIP LPCO:15"},{"s":"type","n":17,"d":18,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"TypeCode","f":"an..3","w":"D013","u":"0001L","q":"15","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/aipTypeCode","l":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/code-list/external/un-edifact-code-list-1001-or-user-code-list","ln":19,"ub":["cites","eata","ecoc","ecoo","etir-carv"],"src":"BIP LPCO:18"},{"s":"Authentication","n":20,"d":21,"t":"C","c":"0..*"